  "lede": "The Brewers finished 103\u201359, the best record in baseball. They lead the Dodgers 4\u20130 in the NLCS and would host Games 1, 2, 6 and 7 of any World Series. Every version of the model makes them the favorite. That still leaves a 0% chance the trophy goes somewhere else.",
